  "description_short": "Garden Route gem serving wholesome, home-style meals in a tranquil country house setting in Wilderness.",
  "description_long": "Tucked away on a quiet Wilderness street, Serendipity Country House & Restaurant offers the kind of unhurried dining experience that makes you want to linger. The restaurant occupies a charming country house with a welcoming atmosphere that feels more like visiting friends than eating out. Their menu focuses on honest, well-prepared food with generous portions – think hearty breakfasts, satisfying lunches, and comforting dinners that showcase quality ingredients without fuss.\n\nThe setting is relaxed and homely, with indoor seating and a lovely garden area where you can enjoy your meal surrounded by greenery. It's the sort of place where locals bring visiting family and where travellers stumble upon something special. The service is warm and attentive, reflecting the personal touch of a family-run establishment.\n\nWhether you're staying in one of their guesthouse rooms or just stopping by for a meal, Serendipity delivers genuine Garden Route hospitality. It's particularly popular for breakfast and Sunday lunches, so booking ahead is wise. The combination of good food, peaceful surroundings, and reasonable prices makes it a Wilderness favourite.",
